{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggF97xYo8ea73AfC1tYS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**D-2: Should gates show you screenshots, not only text?**\n\nRight now, when a gate has pictures, the checker prints the `Preview:` path and the lines from the briefing. You can open those files yourself. A rule that makes FO put pictures into the gate would mean changing `workflow.md` again, and ADR 0020 says that change needs its own raise.\n\n**My recommendation:** Do not add a picture rule now. Keep the printed paths.\n\n**What gets worse:** The gate stays text. You will see the pictures only if you open the printed paths. Nothing puts them in front of you.\n\nIf you want pictures in the gate, say so. I will start that `workflow.md` raise as a separate task.\n\nApproving accepts the recommendation for D-2. Say if you object."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":629,"cache_read_input_tokens":15430,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":629},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d1cf61e-b3af-4f2e-8762-0093f112a25f","uuid":"deca5184-483c-47eb-ba79-936c02133993","timestamp":"2026-11-03T15:38:34.920Z","request_id":"req_011CggF97jemTi2MVKzdJ3pV"}
